        <details class="group py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-medium text-stone-800 hover:text-mogao-700 transition-colors list-none">How many days do I need?<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"/></svg></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed pr-8">Minimum 4 days: 2-3 in Dunhuang, 1-2 in Jiuquan. With 7, add Zhangye. <a href="/itinerary" class="text-mogao-600 hover:text-mogao-700 underline">Itineraries</a>.</p></details>
        <details class="group py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-medium text-stone-800 hover:text-mogao-700 transition-colors list-none">Can I visit Mogao Caves without a guide?<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"/></svg></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed pr-8">No &mdash; everyone joins a guided group. A-ticket: 8 caves over ~75 minutes. Photography banned inside. Book 1-4 weeks ahead in peak season. <a href="/mogao-caves" class="text-mogao-600 hover:text-mogao-700 underline">Guide</a>.</p></details>
        <details class="group py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-medium text-stone-800 hover:text-mogao-700 transition-colors list-none">Can I use Google Maps in China?<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"/></svg></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed pr-8">It has a location offset &mdash; unreliable. Use Apple Maps, Baidu, or offline Maps.me. VPN first.</p></details>
        <details class="group py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-medium text-stone-800 hover:text-mogao-700 transition-colors list-none">Is Gansu safe for solo travelers?<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"/></svg></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed pr-8">Very safe. Real risks are practical: summer heat (35-40C+), language outside hotels, marked paths at Yadan.</p></details>
        <details class="group py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-medium text-stone-800 hover:text-mogao-700 transition-colors list-none">Which is better: Dunhuang or Jiuquan?<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"/></svg></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed pr-8">Dunhuang, if you can only pick one. Jiuquan for history and space. With 5+ days, do both. <a href="/dunhuang-vs-jiuquan" class="text-mogao-600 hover:text-mogao-700 underline">Compare</a>.</p></details>
        <details class="group py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-medium text-stone-800 hover:text-mogao-700 transition-colors list-none">How much should I budget per day?<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"/></svg></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed pr-8">CNY 400-600 budget (hostel, street food, B-tickets); CNY 600-1000 mid-range; CNY 1000-2000 comfort.</p></details>
